                <pb facs="1185" n="1171" xml:id="pg1171"/>

                <head>United States proposals for Chinese-American consultation respecting future
                    status of Korea</head>
                <p>[On September 26 the American and British Ambassadors in China approached the
                    Chinese Minister for Foreign Affairs with a view to exchanging information and
                    ideas in regard to the future of Korea after the war. On November 8 the Chinese
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs replied favorably. Correspondence on the subject of
                    Korea is published in <ref target="frus:frus1944v05/pg_1290">volume V, pages
                        1290</ref>–<ref target="frus:frus1944v05/pg_1298">1298</ref>.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
